{"seq":14,"slug":"ab-testing-experimentation","title":"A/B 测试与实验","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.48,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introMarkdown":"# A/B 测试与实验 简介\n\nA/B 测试是互联网产品迭代中最重要的因果推断工具。通过将用户随机分配到不同方案组并观测关键指标差异，团队能够用数据而非直觉来驱动决策。本知识库从实验设计原理到统计分析方法，从平台架构到高级实验技术，为具备技术背景的工程师提供一套完整的实验方法论体系。\n\n本知识库适合有 3-7 年经验的中高级开发者，特别是参与增长、推荐、搜索等数据密集型业务的工程师，以及正在构建或维护实验平台的基础设施团队成员。你需要具备基本的概率统计知识和编程能力。\n\n第一章**实验设计基础**系统介绍 A/B 测试的方法论框架，包括实验方法论概述、假设构建与变量控制、样本量计算与实验周期规划，以及随机化策略与分组方法。这是后续所有章节的理论基础。\n\n第二章**统计学基础**聚焦实验分析所需的核心统计知识，涵盖假设检验原理、置信区间与 P 值的正确理解，以及统计功效分析。掌握这些概念是正确解读实验结果的前提。\n\n第三章**实验平台与工具**从工程视角出发，讲解实验平台的架构设计、Feature Flag 系统的实现方式，以及实验分析工具与标准化流程的建设。\n\n第四章**高级实验方法**探讨前沿实验技术，包括多臂老虎机算法、交叉实验方法、网络效应与溢出实验的处理，以及长期实验效应的评估方法。这些方法能帮助你应对传统 A/B 测试无法很好解决的复杂场景。\n\n推荐学习路径：按照章节顺序从第一章开始学习。统计基础薄弱的读者可以在第一章之后优先深入第二章。有实验平台建设需求的工程师可以在掌握前两章后直接进入第三章。第四章适合已有丰富实验经验、希望突破瓶颈的读者。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experiment-design","title":"实验设计基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experiment-methodology","title":"实验方法论概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-design/experiment-methodology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hypothesis-formulation","title":"假设构建与变量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-design/hypothesis-formulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sample-size-calculation","title":"样本量计算与实验周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-design/sample-size-calculation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"randomization-strategies","title":"随机化策略与分组方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-design/randomization-strategies"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"statistics-foundations","title":"统计学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/statistics-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hypothesis-testing","title":"假设检验原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/statistics-foundations/hypothesis-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"confidence-intervals-p-values","title":"置信区间与 P 值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/statistics-foundations/confidence-intervals-p-values"},{"seq":3,"slug":"statistical-power-analysis","title":"统计功效分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/statistics-foundations/statistical-power-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"experiment-platforms","title":"实验平台与工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experimentation-platform-architecture","title":"实验平台架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-platforms/experimentation-platform-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feature-flag-systems","title":"Feature Flag 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-platforms/feature-flag-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"experiment-analysis-tools","title":"实验分析工具与流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/experiment-platforms/experiment-analysis-tools"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-methods","title":"高级实验方法","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/advanced-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-armed-bandit","title":"多臂老虎机算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/advanced-methods/multi-armed-bandit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interleaving-experiments","title":"交叉实验方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/advanced-methods/interleaving-experiments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-effects-experiments","title":"网络效应与溢出实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/advanced-methods/network-effects-experiments"},{"seq":4,"slug":"long-term-experiment-effects","title":"长期实验效应评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/ab-testing-experimentation/advanced-methods/long-term-experiment-effects"}]}]}